  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for community based marine turtle nesting beach conservation and bycatch reduction in Viet Nam</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The recipient will implement community based nesting beach conservation programs and bycatch monitoring in Quang Ninh, Quang Tri, Quang Nam, Quang Ngai, Binh Dinh, and Binh Thuan provinces as well an education and outreach activities in 6 coastal communities. Grantee will also conduct rapid assessment of status of hawksbill and leatherback in north central Vietnam as detailed in the proposal.</narrative>
  </description>
